# Lab 05-1 acceptance tests: transfer pump P-101 start permissive.
# Tested:
#  - PermissiveOK for all 8 combinations of the three permissive inputs, with the
#    selector in AUTO, in MAN and in OFF: it depends on the permissives only;
#  - Pump for the same 8 combinations in AUTO with demand and in MAN with a run
#    command: it runs only when all three permissives are healthy, in both modes;
#  - SelectorFault and PermissiveOK for all 8 permissive combinations with both
#    selector contacts made: each output ignores the other's inputs, and Pump is off;
#  - Pump and SelectorFault for all 16 combinations of ManualSel, AutoSel, Demand
#    and ManualRunCmd with every permissive healthy (OFF, AUTO, MAN, and both
#    selector contacts made at once);
#  - no memory anywhere: a running pump stops as soon as its demand, run command,
#    mode or any permissive goes away, and follows the inputs straight back.
# The logic is combinational, so several input combinations are checked one after
# another inside a scenario. Every row sets all the inputs it depends on.
# Only interface variables are used. LSL101_NC is a fail-safe NC input: TRUE = healthy.

scenario in AUTO with demand, PermissiveOK and Pump for all 8 permissive combinations
set AutoSel TRUE
set Demand TRUE
set SuctionOpenLS FALSE        # valve closed, level low, motor fault
set LSL101_NC FALSE
set MotorFault TRUE
scan
expect PermissiveOK FALSE
expect Pump FALSE
set SuctionOpenLS FALSE        # valve closed, level low, no fault
set LSL101_NC FALSE
set MotorFault FALSE
scan
expect PermissiveOK FALSE
expect Pump FALSE
set SuctionOpenLS FALSE        # valve closed, level OK, motor fault
set LSL101_NC TRUE
set MotorFault TRUE
scan
expect PermissiveOK FALSE
expect Pump FALSE
set SuctionOpenLS FALSE        # valve closed, level OK, no fault
set LSL101_NC TRUE
set MotorFault FALSE
scan
expect PermissiveOK FALSE
expect Pump FALSE
set SuctionOpenLS TRUE         # valve open, level low, motor fault
set LSL101_NC FALSE
set MotorFault TRUE
scan
expect PermissiveOK FALSE
expect Pump FALSE
set SuctionOpenLS TRUE         # valve open, level low, no fault
set LSL101_NC FALSE
set MotorFault FALSE
scan
expect PermissiveOK FALSE
expect Pump FALSE
set SuctionOpenLS TRUE         # valve open, level OK, motor fault
set LSL101_NC TRUE
set MotorFault TRUE
scan
expect PermissiveOK FALSE
expect Pump FALSE
set SuctionOpenLS TRUE         # valve open, level OK, no fault
set LSL101_NC TRUE
set MotorFault FALSE
scan
expect PermissiveOK TRUE
expect Pump TRUE

